            "review_title": "Review at Bornga",
            "review_text": "Jessica L\nSingapore7 contributions\n0\nGreat food with great service makes a perfect dining experience.\nNov 2023 • Family\nThe staff are obliging and they understand basic English. The service is efficient. My family and I went there on our first night in Ho Chi Min city. The experience was great and communication was not a big problem. The staff prepared the food for us so we did not have to bbq the food ourselves. The amount of the side dishes was generous. One of the side dish was a plate of raw prawns. We asked the staff to remove it as we did not want to eat anything raw, the staff offered to cook it for us. We were glad as the cooked prawns were tasty. \n\nThe location of the restaurant was great as it was somewhere between our hotel and the shopping mall that we just did our shopping at. In other words, it’s quite easy to locate.\nRead more\nWritten November 9, 2023",
